# signalk-dmi environment template — copy to .env (which is gitignored).
#
# The current DMI Open Data host (opendataapi.dmi.dk) is KEY-FREE — no secret is
# required to run this plugin (verified 2026-07, see RESEARCH.md §2). This file
# exists per the fleet "secrets externalised" rule so that IF DMI reintroduces an
# API key (the retired dmigw.govcloud.dk host required one), you have somewhere to
# put it without changing code.
#
# DMI_API_KEY=your-key-here-if-ever-required